Error: The value 'macos' is invalid for '--platform <platform>'. Please provide one of 'ios' and 'android'.
Help:  --platform <platform>  Target platform: ios or android. Defaults to whichever of grantiva.yml / grantiva-android.yml exists, else the project files in this directory. GRANTIVA_PLATFORM also sets it.
Usage: grantiva run <options>
  See 'grantiva run --help' for more information.
